  "goodToKnow": "Der Schnitzer is a blunder or howler: ein grober Schnitzer, ein grammatischer Schnitzer. It also means a woodcarver, from schnitzen (to carve): Oberammergau and the Erzgebirge are famous for their Holzschnitzer and carved nativity figures and nutcrackers. Synonyms for mistake: der Patzer, der Fauxpas, der Lapsus. The plural is the same: die Schnitzer."
